  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful\nاَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَدْرَكَۙ‏(1)\nALAM NASHRAH LAKA SADRAKA.\n(O’ Our Apostle Muhammad!) What! Have We not expanded for thee thy breast?\nوَوَضَعْنَا عَنْكَ وِزْرَكَۙ‏(2)\nWA WAZA’NAA A’NKA WIZRAKAL.\nAnd We took off from thee thy burden?\nالَّذِىْۤ اَنْقَضَ ظَهْرَكَۙ‏(3)\nLAZEE ANQAZA ZAHRAKA.\nWhich weighed down thy back?\nوَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَؕ‏(4)\nWA RA-FA’NAA LAKA ZIKRAK.\nAnd exalted we for thee, thy fame?\nفَاِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا ۙ‏(5)\nFA-INNA MA-A’L U’SRE YUSRAN.\nVerily with (every) difficulty (there) is ease\nاِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا ؕ‏(6)\nINNA MA-A’L U’SRE YUSRAA.\nVerily with (every) difficulty (there) is ease\nفَاِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَانْصَبْۙ‏(7)\nFA-EZAA FARAGHTA FAN-SAB.\nAnd when thou hast finished (the duties of thy ministry), then thou establish it!\nوَاِلٰى رَبِّكَ فَارْغَب‏(8)\nWA ELAA RABBEKA FAR-GHAB.\nAnd unto thy Lord, return with fervour",
